## `polkagent-billing` crate — complete

### Files created

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `Cargo.toml` | Dependencies on `polkagent-core`, `polkagent-payment`, `polkagent-event`, plus `serde`, `chrono`, `tokio`, `tracing`, `thiserror`, `uuid` |
| `src/lib.rs` | Module declarations and public re-exports |
| `src/error.rs` | `BillingError` enum (`RunNotFound`, `NoCostData`, `Store`, `Export`) |
| `src/cost.rs` | **Per-run cost computation** — `RunCostCalculator` wraps `polkagent-payment::CostEstimator` to compute `RunCost` per run; `compute_aggregate()` produces `AggregateCost` from a slice of `CostRecord`s |
| `src/meter.rs` | **Metered event emission** — `MeterEmitter` emits `MeteredEvent` structs (with `RunCompleted`/`TurnCompleted` kinds) on run completion, logging via `tracing::info` and buffering for downstream consumption via `drain()` |
| `src/export.rs` | **Audit-export CSV** — `export_csv()` and `export_csv_bytes()` render `CostRecord`s to RFC-4180 CSV with proper field escaping, reconcilable with run logs |
| `src/routes.rs` | **REST endpoint helpers** — `build_summary()` → `BillingSummaryResponse` for `GET /v1/billing/summary`; `build_export()` → `BillingExportResponse` for `GET /v1/billing/export` |

